			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"masterpiece, very aesthetic, score_7, score_9, sensitive, ultra detailed, \n--preview, \nStudio Ghibli Dark Fairytale, \nin ANIRL Style, \n@NJSW33T, \ndynamic pose, \ndepth of field. A masterful, highly-detailed full-body anime illustration of Hatsune Miku, smiling gently. She is depicted standing amidst a vast, sprawling garden meadow completely carpeted with large white roses, pink daisies, yellow flowers, and lush green leaves, appearing as an infinite natural floral floor. Miku has a slender build and extremely long, dynamic, swirling teal pigtails that flow in multiple wavy coiling trails, reaching almost to her ankles. The pigtails feature a dramatic color gradient, starting as vibrant emerald-teal at the roots and gradually fading to a very light, milky-white at the tips, interwoven with small delicate white flowers throughout. Over her left shoulder, the small panda plush figure with its tiny flower is perched. She holds a traditional East Asian paper parasol (wagasa/oiled paper umbrella). The parasol is explicitly built with a natural bamboo stem and frame, covered with textured traditional Hanji/washi paper featuring sepia-toned floral patterns. Crucially, the inner ribs (parasol ribs) are perfectly straight bamboo sticks radiating outward, forming a rigid conical cone structure, rather than modern curved dome-shaped metal ribs. She wears an elaborate, stylized modern modernized Hanbok -inspired outfit, tailored to reveal her legs. The top features a short Jeogori in a deep teal color with sophisticated gold and black embroidery patterns, featuring modern, simplified sleeves and a clean white Dongjeong (collar). The bottom is a modern, shortened chima (skirt) that rises above the knees, layered with black and white fabrics and intricate gold trim, showcasing her long legs. The outfit retains the essential teal, black, and gold color palette of the original, but transformed into a sophisticated, modern Korean fashion statement. She wears high white boots that now reach her mid-calf. The background is a detailed traditional Japanese stroll garden under a clearing sky directly after a heavy rainfall, featuring cherry blossom trees, pine trees, and temple buildings like a pagoda, all gleaming with wetness. Sunlight is breaking through departing rain clouds, creating a fresh, post-rain atmosphere with clear, detailed water reflections on all wet surfaces."
			],
